  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Aar Government Services has $237M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Aar Government Services won 163 awards in the period, with an average award size of $1.5M. Aar Government Services obligations are down 31.8% year over year. The Department of Defense obligated $181M to Aar Government Services, and the Department of State obligated $56.1M. Other Support Activities for Air Transportation is the largest market for Aar Government Services at $202M, followed by Other Aircraft Parts and Auxiliary Equipment Manufacturing at $38.5M. Aar Government Services obligations by fiscal year show variation: FY21 $324M, FY22 $256M, FY23 $363M, FY24 $324M, FY25 $347M, and FY26 $237M. The FY2026 totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date obligations only. This overview focuses on obligations, buyer breakdowns, award counts, average award size, and market concentrations relevant to contractors and procurement watchers tracking Aar Government Services.",
